If you breach these conditions, the permissions granted to you for the affected Covered Material terminate while the breach continues. The Licensor may reinstate them in writing. For a first breach that is capable of cure, permissions reinstate automatically if you fully cure within 30 days of discovering it or receiving notice, whichever is earlier, unless the Licensor has already notified you of a prior breach of this license. Completed excess sales cannot be retroactively authorized merely by stopping sales; resolution requires the Licensor’s written agreement. This section does not predetermine damages or create automatic penalties.

